WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.450
Chapter 05 is how the
existing estate gets there.

2
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:08.640
The sources described three separate kits
that repeated most of the same steps,

3
00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:13.515
because the destination is the same:
servers in Arc, workstations in Intune,

4
00:00:13.515 --> 00:00:18.075
NTLM restricted after it's measured,
and Conditional Access enforced.

5
00:00:18.075 --> 00:00:20.575
What differs is who holds
the decision record.

6
00:00:20.575 --> 00:00:26.175
The rule all three obey: the control
plane governs, the data plane executes.

7
00:00:26.175 --> 00:00:29.981
Every path runs four phases
in order, observe, onboard,

8
00:00:29.981 --> 00:00:34.825
harden and watch, and nothing is
restricted until it's been measured.

9
00:00:34.825 --> 00:00:37.925
The manual path suits
small estates and pilots.

10
00:00:37.925 --> 00:00:41.800
The governed path puts an approval
reference on every change.

11
00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.706
The retrofit adopts a
hand-modernized estate,

12
00:00:44.706 --> 00:00:47.688
at the risk of blessing
whatever drift is there.

13
00:00:47.688 --> 00:00:52.460
And the federal ceiling is human
approval; autonomous action is refused.
